  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.31 Add scoped queue clearing, session support, lock-backed message settlement and DLQ replay.\n\t\t1.0.30 Add temporary security pins for MessagePack, System.IdentityModel.Tokens.Jwt and YamlDotNet.\n\t\t1.0.29 Refresh container base images on every build to pick up .NET security patches.\n\t\t1.0.28 Updated readme and version of Aspire AppHost\n\t\t1.0.27 Allow Aspire to assign a free external port by default while keeping explicit custom ports supported.\n\t\t1.0.26 Allow null port to allow Aspire to set and some package upgrade.\n\t\t1.0.25 Nest emulatorUI under the emulator via .WithUI() and some package upgrades\n\t\t1.0.24 Fixed formatting issue with very long entity names\n\t\t1.0.21 Fix issue with monaco editor\n\t\t1.0.20 Fix an issue with replacement tokens not being processed properly in MessageSender component\n\t\t1.0.19 Improved settings persistence using local storage in the UI\n\t\t1.0.17 Add support for container connectivity using podman\n\t\t1.0.13 Added logging to entity discovery\n\t\t1.0.10 add support for entity names containing periods\n\t\t1.0.9 Tie extension method to specific docker image tag\n\t\t1.0.6 add semver tag to docker image build workflow and AddAsbEmulatorUI() extension method\n\t\t1.0.2 net10.0\n\t\t1.0.1 moved some Types and removed an incorrect dependency\n\t\t1.0.0 initial version",
